question/worked-solution "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P-Q & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 4 & 9 \\\\ 7 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 10 & 0 & -3\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -8 & 6 \\\\ -4 & 3 & -7 \\\\ 12 & -5 & 9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-6-1 & 4-(-8) & 9-6 \\\\ 7-(-4) & -2-3 & 5-(-7) \\\\ 10-12 & 0-(-5) & -3-9\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 & \\,\\,12 & 3 \\\\ \\,\\,\\,11 & -5 & 12 \\\\ -2 & 5 & -12\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186335984 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25c0580a-41f6-5d9a-9c8d-d1cec501b9a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -7 & -9 \\\\ -1 & 14 & -13\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333338} {:answer/id #uuid "3926fda8-51f5-51cf-826d-d80611e5ff61" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & -5 \\\\ 6 & -9 & 11\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186333523} {:answer/id #uuid "75c4ccde-f29b-5f98-8e5a-095cb79e5d96" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -9 & 11 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186334053} {:answer/id #uuid "e6714eab-8883-5152-91ba-d87d8c346827" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 7 & 11 \\\\ -1 & 14 & -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335001} {:answer/id #uuid "f8699957-4b4d-5838-87d2-12a52e72da4e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 11 & -9 \\\\ -1 & -5 & -2\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335164}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186334053} :answer-field/id #uuid "7105b117-fd04-5afa-82c0-7e01aaab6677" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186335458}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "bb969907-0d5e-590c-8aaa-5a753b6853bf" :question/math-academy-id "q-69603" :question/problem "$\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -8 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -9\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & -10 \\\\ -1 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix}=$" :question/worked-solution "We subtract the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & -8 & 1 \\\\ -2 & 6 & -9\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & -10 \\\\ -1 & 8 & -4\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4-(-2) & -8-1 & 1-(-10) \\\\ -2-(-1) & 6-8 & -9-(-4)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}6 & -9 & 11 \\\\ -1 & -2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Subtracting Matrices"} :step/id #uuid "6ab1f2a9-9a57-5ab5-afd8-2b6a0e402c6a" :step/math-academy-id 16082} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055593 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055975 :tutorial/content "We can subtract matrices in the same way that we add matrices: we subtract the corresponding entries. Again, we can only do this if they have the same number of rows and columns, that is, they have the same dimensions.\n\nFor example, consider the matrices\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nWe see that both $A$ and $B$ are $2\\times 2$ matrices, so, we can subtract them. The difference ${A} - {B}\\,$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-B & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}-\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1-1 & 3-0 \\\\ 2-0 & 4-(-1)\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAgain, the difference of two matrices is another matrix with the same dimensions." :tutorial/id #uuid "6c907b34-7db5-5717-84ac-d2425bf6dbc3" :tutorial/math-academy-id 2986 :tutorial/title "Subtracting Matrices"} :step/id #uuid "7c3091d8-48ac-5b83-a4a8-d616aee10102" :step/math-academy-id 16138 :step/next {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055592}} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186055594 :step/content {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054650 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054547 :question/id #uuid "b77816bd-e128-5888-9973-97c51c99f7f0" :question/math-academy-id "e-4396" :question/problem "Calculate ${A}+ {B},$ where\n\n$$\n{A}=\n    \\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 4 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix},\n\\quad\n{B}=\n    \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "We add the corresponding entries:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 3 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 4 & -1 & 2\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & -3 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3 & 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}1+(-2) & 3+(-3) & 1+1 & 0+1 \\\\ 2+1 & 4+(-2) & -1+3 & 2+1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 2 & 2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "95627f8c-4151-5565-8803-7558bd674acb" :knowledge-point/question-generator {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186510624 :question-generator/id #uuid "ecac811a-b08e-5ada-a717-9e4e5dc85eba" :question-generator/script "generate/scratch/17592186054650.py"} :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186054942 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9c97412b-35c6-5588-a1be-f3a8d596ffca" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -12 \\\\ 8 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -20\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186051183} {:answer/id #uuid "ba291ab2-6c7b-5365-a5bd-039dbdd66a1a" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -12 \\\\ 6 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 20\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186051184} {:answer/id #uuid "3c23f8b8-66c0-5b57-89bb-3c464e55b480" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -12 \\\\ 6 & 9 \\\\ 1 & -20\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186051185} {:answer/id #uuid "4a5b3022-721b-57c3-b721-7afbcdf77f84" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & -12 \\\\ 6 & 1 \\\\ 17 & 20\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 175921860